msgid "# Getting Started"
msgstr "# 快速入门"

msgid ""
"Welcome to the vLLM Ascend plugin. This section guides you from environment "
"setup to your first inference workload."
msgstr "欢迎使用 vLLM Ascend 插件。本节将引导您从环境搭建到运行第一个推理任务。"

msgid "## Quick Navigation"
msgstr "## 快速导航"

msgid ""
"- [Quick Start](quick_start.md): Run your first model using a prebuilt image.\n"
"- [Installation Guide](installation.md): Set up the driver, CANN, Python, Docker, and source installation environments.\n"
"- [Model Tutorials](../tutorials/models/index.md): Find deployment instructions for specific models.\n"
"- [Feature Tutorials](../tutorials/features/index.md): Learn about advanced features such as PD disaggregation and context parallelism.\n"
"- [FAQ](../faqs.md): Troubleshoot common deployment and runtime issues."
msgstr ""
"- [快速开始](quick_start.md)：使用预构建镜像运行您的第一个模型。\n"
"- [安装指南](installation.md)：配置驱动、CANN、Python、Docker 及源码安装环境。\n"
"- [模型教程](../tutorials/models/index.md)：查找特定模型的部署说明。\n"
"- [功能教程](../tutorials/features/index.md)：了解 PD 分离和上下文并行等高级功能。\n"
"- [常见问题](../faqs.md)：排查常见的部署和运行时问题。"
